 previously saved date\", \"actual\": \"With 2027-09-04 saved (today 2026-08-28), entering past date 2020-03-15 and clicking Save closed the dialog with no error; dashboard date became \\\"Mar 15, 2020\\\" and the countdown element disappeared entirely.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Listing detail views cannot be opened; \\\"View Details\\\"/\\\"View Profile\\\" buttons are inert\", \"actual\": \"Clicked venues.grid.item.v1.details (\\\"View Details\\\") and vendors.grid.item.vn3.profile (\\\"View Profile\\\"). Neither produced any change: no dialog/modal element in the DOM (querySelectorAll for [role=dialog],dialog,[class*=modal],[class*=detail] returned 0), URL stayed on /venues and /vendors, page content and result count unchanged, no console errors. There is no way to view a listing's complete details.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Marking cl5-1 → state \\\"completed\\\", checklist progress 0%→20% immediately; marking cl5-2 → 40%; unmarking cl5-2 → back to 20% and state \\\"not-completed\\\". Dashboard aggregate progress showed 9% (1 of 11 tasks across saved checklists cl1+cl5). After full page reload, cl5-1 remained \\\"completed\\\", progress still 20%, dashboard still 9%.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"No submit button exists; results and \\\"Showing X of Y\\\" count updated immediately on each filter toggle and on each search keystroke fill. \\\"Clear all filters\\\" restored venues to 8 of 8 and vendors to 10 of 10 with search box emptied.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cancel does not discard the draft; editor reopens with cancelled values instead of last saved values\", \"actual\": \"Saved state was Alicia Morgan/Benjamin Carter, 2027-09-04, $52,500, 85. Edited partnerOne→\\\"DISCARD ME\\\", budget→999999,